    "IGUI_GFL2_Subtitle_GFL2PmxSextans_Kill_A": "너무 약하군.",
    "IGUI_GFL2_Subtitle_GFL2PmxSextans_Kill_B": "자, 어떤 반응을 보여 줄까?",
    "IGUI_GFL2_Subtitle_GFL2PmxSextans_Kill_C": "볼썽사나운 발악이었군.",
    "IGUI_GFL2_Subtitle_GFL2PmxSextans_Kill_D": "죽어 버리면 곤란하다고?",
    "IGUI_GFL2_Subtitle_GFL2PmxSextans_Kill_E": "…조용해졌군.",
    "IGUI_GFL2_Subtitle_GFL2PmxSextans_Kill_F": "나중에 청소해 둬야겠군.",
    "IGUI_GFL2_Subtitle_GFL2PmxSextans_Kill_G": "도망칠 셈이야?",
    "IGUI_GFL2_Subtitle_GFL2PmxSextans_Kill_H": "바라던 바입니다.",
